  "notes": "Quadratic Wenkai curves preserved; advance 1000. Weight correction: widen upper horizontal by 26 em units (13 each edge) and upper upright by 10 units. Original quadratic topology, layout and other components preserved. Full-body weight correction: open both 白 counters by 10 units per vertical edge, 5–10 per horizontal edge; reduce outer side of initial falling stroke by 12 units. Layout and right component preserved. Unified stroke balance: upper-right horizontal +10 units, lower-right horizontals +4 units, reinforce short diagonal and hook body. Left component and placement retained. Form correction: remove intermediate horizontal and angular bend. Replace with diagonal descending left into a large curved hook, matching NNT form. Keep Wenkai bar and rounded stroke treatment.",
